From: Qore packaging maintainers
Subject: Index memory-store subjects for bounded filtered delivery
Copyright 2026 Qore Technologies, s.r.o.

Keep a compressed sequence set for each multi-message subject and use its
lower-bound lookup during literal filtered delivery. Preserve lazy subject
bounds and all message-store lifecycle paths. Fix unsigned upper-bound
comparisons in SequenceSet so the full uint64 range remains searchable.

